{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/ShatterLand_LibraryHero23.png?t=1749934823\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/ShatterLand_TitlesBanner-1.png?t=1749934823\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddea <strong>Uncover Your Past</strong> <br>Explore the remnants of the lab, uncover lost files, and slowly recover the truth\u2014and your stolen powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/UnrealEditor_2ivpcDuTPt-ezgif.com-optimize_1_.gif?t=1749934823\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You were taken as a child:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ripped from your home and locked away in a secret laboratory. You were different\u2014your parents knew it. The government knew it. And they wanted to use you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tested. Modified. Controlled. <br>You were meant to be a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Years passed. Your powers were stolen, replicated, and twisted. The military tried to create enhanced soldiers using your DNA. But the experiment failed\u2014horribly. The result wasn\u2019t strength... it was devastation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The world collapsed. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/ShatterLand_TitlesBanner-2.png?t=1749934823\" /></div>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Open-World Exploration</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through a devastated post-apocalyptic world, filled with zombies, survivors, and military ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/Untitledvideo-MadewithClipchamp-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749934823\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/extras/ShatterLand_TitlesBanner-Recovered.png?t=1749934823\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Shatterland is a story-driven, open-world zombie survival game with exploration, base-building, skill progression, and co-op play.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Description:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Vibrant Low-Poly World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the unique visual appeal of a stylized low-poly landscape that enhances your adventure with charm and clarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Survive Together</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or with friends in online co-op. Team up to share resources, build stronger defenses, and face bigger threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udddf <strong>Fight to Survive</strong><br>Battle hordes of the undead, hostile survivors, and mutated experiments gone wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Loot &amp; Equip</strong><br>Find powerful firearms, melee weapons, and equipment to increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Vehicle System</strong><br>Repair, maintain, and upgrade vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Build &amp; Barricade</strong><br>Create safe zones in buildings or wild areas. Fortify your base against the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Day/Night Cycle</strong><br>Every moment counts. Visibility and threats change with time and weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong><br>Level up by doing. Unlock new abilities, and eventually regain pieces of your stolen power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Trade &amp; Customize</strong><br>Barter with survivors, tweak difficulty, and make the experience your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721680?t=1749934823","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/8afc3da432cdf2555301ee87b2e6957ee8602ee8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749934823","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/d737107b4375f054e23a9736bca8340274e0c400/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749934823","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/d737107b4375f054e23a9736bca8340274e0c400/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749934823","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img 