zones in buildings or wild areas. Fortify your base against the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Day/Night Cycle</strong><br>Every moment counts. Visibility and threats change with time and weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong><br>Level up by doing. Unlock new abilities, and eventually regain pieces of your stolen power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Trade &amp; Customize</strong><br>Barter with survivors, tweak difficulty, and make the experience your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["LastPulse Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721680/a79a75e73536aff140fc93608fd4de198f8b4291/header.jpg?t=1749934823","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All right reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257156477,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156477/movie480.mp4?t=1749825682","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156477/movie_max.mp4?t=1749825682"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257156477/c1429b4085093c77272ff04b41929f3ba18543d9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749825682","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156477/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749825682","max":"ht